WEBVTT

00:07:30.246 --> 00:07:32.663
The only certainty is uncertainty,

00:07:32.663 --> 00:07:36.163
and yet we are not navigating this frailty
successfully or sustainably.

00:07:37.413 --> 00:07:40.913
The World Health Organization tells
us that depression is now

00:07:40.913 --> 00:07:45.329
the single leading cause of
disability globally and at

00:07:45.329 --> 00:07:50.704
a time of greater complexity,
unprecedented technological,

00:07:50.704 --> 00:07:52.288
political and economic change,

00:07:53.246 --> 00:07:55.704
we are seeing how people's
tendency is more

00:07:55.704 --> 00:07:58.954
and more to lock down into rigid
responses to their emotions.